## 🔥 Your Advanced MySQL Learning Order

Don't learn MySQL as just SQL syntax. For your target of **backend + system-design interviews**, use this progression:

```text
SQL Fundamentals
      ↓
JOINs
      ↓
Subqueries
      ↓
CTEs
      ↓
Window Functions
