B+ Trees
      ↓
InnoDB
      ↓
Query Optimizer
      ↓
EXPLAIN / EXPLAIN ANALYZE
      ↓
Transactions
      ↓
ACID
      ↓
Isolation Levels
      ↓
MVCC
      ↓
Locks
      ↓
Deadlocks
      ↓
Redo / Undo Logs
      ↓
Crash Recovery
      ↓
Replication
      ↓
