The **highest-value transition** is:

**SQL → Indexes → B+ Tree → InnoDB → Query Optimizer → EXPLAIN → Transactions → MVCC → Locks → Deadlocks → Replication → Sharding.**

That sequence takes you from **"I know SQL"** to **"I understand how MySQL actually works in production."**

